From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:12:14 +0200
Subject: resolved: enforce local DNS domain suffix blocking

Hook the downstream DNS-name policy before hosts, cached answers and
upstream transactions. Cover search expansions, alias restarts and all
stub query types using the existing parser and response helpers.
Keep TCP streams alive until queued failure replies are sent.

Add BlockedDomainFile configuration and privileged ReloadBlockLists for
atomic replacement without clearing DNS caches. Register the separately
supplied blocklist module and tests, and document the downstream options.
